+2.  **Progressive Loop:**
+    *   Iterate $n$ from 1 to `iters` (total number of new views to synthesize, e.g., 32):
+        1.  Randomly sample a new camera view pose $p$ from the trajectory set $\{p_k\}$ [S1].
